        </div>
        <p class="article-footnote">† See companion essay: <a href="https://www.wordsofplainness.org/studies/broken-vessels/" class="article-companion-link"><em>Broken Vessels — Universal Fallibility and the Reach of Grace</em></a>.</p>
    </div>